# Store and geography

See `rule/store-and-geo.md`.

- Mutate lists only inside `update(fn)` with a new object `{ ...s, key: next }`.
- Persist only after `ready`. Merge `localStorage` JSON onto `createSeedState()`.
- New entities: add the array in seed, add `add*` / `upsert*` with `id` and `createdAt`, add `geoPath` if the record has a place.
- `GEO_LEVELS` is the only level list. Nodes need `id`, `name`, `level`, `parentId`.
- Match areas with `descendantIds` / `contactInArea`, not string names.

```javascript
// Wrong
contact.area === "Chomu"

// Right
inArea(contact.geoPath, areaId)
```
